          "short": "$x=7,\\ y=-2$.",
          "worked": "Add the equations to eliminate $y$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}7x&=49\\\\x&=7\\end{align*}$$\n\nSubstitute into the second equation.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}21+y&=19\\\\y&=-2\\end{align*}$$",
