        "prompt": "$$\\begin{aligned}4x-3y&=18\\\\2x-y&=10\\end{aligned}$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=6,\\ y=2$.",
          "worked": "Double the second equation, then subtract the first.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}4x-2y&=20\\\\(4x-2y)-(4x-3y)&=20-18\\\\y&=2\\end{align*}$$\n\nSubstitute into the second equation.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}2x-2&=10\\\\2x&=12\\\\x&=6\\end{align*}$$",
